 ---[m
 [m
[31m-## SKU / Inventory Rules[m
[31m-- SKU is the primary identifier and must be immutable once published.[m
[31m-- Any SKU generation or transformation logic must be deterministic.[m
[31m-- Inventory updates must be idempotent.[m
[31m-- Never auto-correct SKU or inventory values silently.[m
[32m+[m[32m## Data / State Rules[m
[32m+[m[32m- DB / Supabase のカラムは `snake_case`[m
[32m+[m[32m- フロントの型・state も `snake_case`[m
[32m+[m[32m- state 分離原則：[m
[32m+[m[32m  - raw（入力・APIレスポンス原文）[m
[32m+[m[32m  - normalized（正規化後）[m
[32m+[m[32m  - derived（計算・表示用）[m
[32m+[m[32m- APIレスポンス原文は上書き・破壊しない[m
 [m
 ---[m
 [m
[31m-## Server / Client Boundary[m
[31m-- eBay API calls, authentication, and validation must occur server-side.[m
[31m-- Client components are responsible only for:[m
[31m-  - User interaction[m
[31m-  - Local UI state[m
[31m-- Do not add `"use client"` unless strictly required.[m
[32m+[m[32m## External API / eBay Rules[m
[32m+[m[32m- eBay API レスポンスは **必ず保存 or ログ化**[m
[32m+[m[32m- API失敗時：[m
[32m+[m[32m  - 再実行可能な形で状態を残す[m
[32m+[m[32m- API仕様変更を前提とする[m
[32m+[m[32m  - 直書き実装は禁止[m
[32m+[m[32m  - ラッパー関数経由で扱う[m
 [m
 ---[m
 [m
[31m-## API / Validation Rules[m
[31m-- Validate all external input at the boundary.[m
[31m-- Validation errors return 4xx responses.[m
[31m-- External service failures return 5xx responses.[m
[31m-- API response shape must be consistent:[m
[31m-  - Success: `{ ok: true, data: ... }`[m
[31m-  - Error: `{ ok: false, error: { code, message } }`[m
[31m-- Do not leak raw eBay error payloads directly to the client.[m
