[32m+[m[32m- 認証・API通信・validation は Server 側で行う[m
[32m+[m[32m- Client は UI と一時状態管理のみ[m
[32m+[m[32m- `"use client"` は最小限[m
 [m
 ---[m
 [m
[31m-## Logging / Auditing[m
[31m-- Log at minimum:[m
[31m-  - Who (system/user)[m
[31m-  - Action[m
[31m-  - Affected SKU / Listing ID[m
[31m-  - Result[m
[31m-- Do not log tokens, cookies, or personal buyer data.[m
[31m-- Logs must be sufficient for post-incident analysis.[m
